    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\noutbuilding, by reason of its&amp;nbsp; overall scale and height would fail to\r\nrespect the prevailing pattern of the development in the locality, to the\r\ndetriment of the character and appearance of the area, contrary to the high\r\nquality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026),\r\nPolicies D3 (D(1)) and D(11)) of The London Plan (2021), Policies GR1 Harrow Local\r\nPlan 2021-2041and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential\r\nDesign Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
